# Fetched APKs (scp'd back from the remote build host).
/build/

# Android release signing material — NEVER commit. The keystore + its base64
# are secrets; store the base64 in GitHub Actions secrets and back up the
# keystore file somewhere safe (losing it means you can't ship app updates).
# `*.keystore*` also covers the .base64 and .creds.txt sidecars.
*.keystore*
*.jks
keystore.properties

